  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6f0af3707a5107bddc66ece62a695b8a925790c53db0f346e575a04ec0438e8c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "客棧在尚蜀有十數個分號。不過，分號並不叫行裕，也許叫行祿，也許叫行福，而叫行裕的，只此一家。\n當然也只此一家，既能見近處高樓夜景，亦能眺遠方雙月映湖。掌櫃的選址，從來只看風景。至於什麼客流，租價，那是從來不在意的。\n風景好了，客人心情就好。風景好了，便是與天地同心，想不賺錢都難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......確實是好茶，好景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "初來乍到，挑個好地方落腳。對尚蜀有個好印象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行裕客棧，很古雅的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是家名店，但最早不是做餐飲這行的，不過這些年突然轉了行，掌櫃的有本事，做起生意來也是順風順水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便家大業大，老掌櫃的也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是那位忙忙碌碌的老先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半點看不出老闆模樣，兢兢業業，令人心生敬佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是不知道我那位姓梁的昔日同窗......如今在做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己說了嘛，兢兢業業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是個好官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "街上隨便拉個路人，擦鞋的，賣山芋的，或者計程車司機，誰提到梁大人都豎大拇指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈哈，那也算是他得償所願了，羡慕不來啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽梁大人提起，你與他，已有十多年沒見了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可梁大人依然選你，來送這件貨物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你倆的關係，也要豎大拇指了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒見識，看不出這東西的好壞，只是看梁大人那神色就知道，此事大意不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡哪裡，我可不敢與“梁大人”高攀什麼關係，不過要說梁洵此人，倒確實算個朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好朋友難得。十幾年沒見過了，還能當好朋友的，更難得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你呢，慎師傅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "碼頭渡口有那麼多擺渡師傅，我偏偏上了你的船，你就不奇怪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不奇怪。梁大人交代過我，那多半也交代過你。具體的，我沒必要問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是替梁大人從走私販手裡搶來的，費了不少功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我沒問，你倒也說了，憋得慌吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千里迢迢，實在缺個說話的伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倒是信得過那姓梁的，明明他長了副生人勿近的冷淡嘴臉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎。你信他，是因為他是你朋友，我信他，是因為他是尚蜀的父母官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位認識？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "認識，梁大人對我們好，就認識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎師傅做這行多少年了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記不清啦......誰掰著手指頭數自己漂泊了多少年呢？約莫有個......二三十年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎師傅也值得敬佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "船夫而已，有啥好敬佩的。這幾年船都裝上發動機了，再過幾年，我怕我都要失業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也得靠人引航尋路，看一路天況如何。想來走水路的船夫，但凡水路長些，歲月久些，也都和天災信使相去無幾了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......天災啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不常遇到，但要是遇到了，終生難忘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎師傅遇見過天災？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遇見過，但也見過比天災更嚇人的，不過不是在江上——得了，說這些做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......稀奇，好像是外國人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，客人兩位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是你說的“名聲在外，菜品一絕，服務周到，童叟無欺”的行裕客棧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然當然，我師父過去就曾誇獎過“行裕”，一直沒機會來尚蜀，這不就特地帶恩人找來了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，說來慚愧，師父只是誇了，沒說誇什麼。所以我也不知道這行裕客棧厲害在哪兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來，茶水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位，打尖還是住店？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哦，標準的客棧開場詞欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，您別說，咱們雖然開張沒幾年，可真要論“行裕”這個名字，也算個百年老字號啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，反正是要找個落腳處的。這裡價格也合適，離約定的北渡口也不遠，不如？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是隨便啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客房兩間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。要吃點東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都有什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推薦套餐就打在牌子上。現在按午市算，您有什麼需要，招呼一聲就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我瞧瞧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個看起來不錯欸，很有大炎風情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......恩人，這個特辣毛血旺套餐......我們還是別點了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？入鄉隨俗，幹嘛不嘗試一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根據我的經驗，這種菜品，不適合您這樣的雷姆必拓人在中午大快朵頤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣嗎？我還挺能吃辣的喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看那邊那位掌櫃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼厲害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有這麼大一份家業，當然厲害。不過更厲害的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......手上有繭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人果然好眼力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且從進門起，二樓就有兩位客人在打量我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼一直盯著他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦......怎麼那位卡特斯看著這麼面熟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掌櫃的，您今天就待咱們這兒？不去渡口那邊看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去，今天和人有約了，就在這兒待客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，掌櫃的還特地親自接待，那想必是個大客戶了，咱們今天也能開張了？能賺多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錢未必賺得，事兒倒是少不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是那邊的生意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是也不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此話怎講？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼囉嗦，還不快去迎客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，小氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸歡迎光臨，幾位客官，不知——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜小姐？您這是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和你沒關係，一邊去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇——姑娘好大的嗓門，找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一身花裡胡哨的穿著，戴眼鏡，看著像神棍的邋遢小哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是你了，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃......這評價是不是有點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你的仇家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，再怎麼說他們也不至於喊個小丫頭來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說誰小丫頭呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（一腳挑飛了木椅——好腿法！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。坐著就能躲開，反應倒挺快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大小姐，大小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹嘛，沒看我忙著——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這男人是個黎博利吧，我記得信上說，那人是龍來著......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就是樓上那個人了，是你了，對吧！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，起碼道個歉吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我自覺衣品不錯來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看這架勢，來者不善哪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "進門欺負一下木椅，可憐那位小哥險些白挨了一頓打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然已經被本小姐找到，就老老實實把東西交出來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，敢在光天化日之下混進城，你也算膽子大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這位杜小姐，怕是有什麼誤會吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是從龍門來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是帶著一隻古董酒盞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那本小姐給你一分鐘時間狡辯。時間到了，就乖乖把東西交了，跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這年頭小姑娘都這樣不聽人話嗎......真讓人懷念我家那幾個懂事的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不用這麼看我。梁大人也交代過，這酒盞是他專程托你從龍門帶來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然梁大人說了，那我就信任他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是，多謝慎師傅信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稀奇了......既然是梁大人所托，這小丫頭竟然還敢光明正大說要搶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這隻酒盞，是我家某位大姑娘從一夥走私販子手裡搶來的，要真說有沒有合法手續......哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒盞很奇特？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調查過一番，只留下些不明所以的傳說，是那些走私販從當地人口中聽來的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，怎麼就撞上這麼麻煩的事情了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小烏有，這一幕我在電影裡見過哎！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我也見過！不過一般這種時候就要喊警察啦，總不至於真打起來......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，別嘀嘀咕咕了，想好藉口了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這小姑娘，扯起嗓門中氣十足啊......二樓那兩位，就是嫌疑人了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（恩人？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小烏有......那個人......我好像認識......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（什麼？那位確實與我有七分形似兩分神似的人？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不是，他......呃......算羅德島的合作人......還有一分呢？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣吧，這位小姐，反正我已經被你抓到了，逃不掉，不如把警察喊來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想拖延時間是吧，好啊，本小姐倒要看看你能拖延多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給我上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別讓他跑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "且慢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎麼，想給剛才的事討個公道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你讓本小姐辦完事，你這兩天在這裡的開銷，本小姐就包了，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，您先仔細瞧瞧，要是認錯了人，我們攬上這事可就虧大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鯉先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......金頭髮，看不出睜眼還是閉眼的小兔子......你是羅德島的幹員？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天下之大，大炎之大，尚蜀之大，恩人恰好能在一家小酒館裡他鄉遇故知，是多低的機率......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還請各位，給個薄面，莫要掃興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——什麼亂七八糟的，你們果然是一夥的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圍住他們！今天不把贓物交出來，誰也別想走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g07_fairyland_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g07_fairyland_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哦？為何突然有此想法？\n夢見罔兩問景，有感而發。\n那我倒是想瞧瞧，這些尋常物件，你打算如何讓它們顯靈？\n就當是我無心之舉吧，別笑話我就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼......剛才......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是些普通人，下手輕點哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個黎博利是個練家子的！小心點！這個卡特斯就交給我——欸？人呢？"
